         <dc:subject>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li>Set during Harry Potter's sixth year at Hogwarts</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>the novel explores Lord Voldemort's past</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>and Harry's preparations for the final battle amidst emerging romantic relationships and the emotional confusions and conflict resolutions characteristic of mid-adolescence.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
         </dc:subject>
